{"4589000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Step", "steam_appid": 4589000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a runner in a neon void. The silent world pulses once again to the music you bring. Race against time, against gravity, against everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/6e1cbafe38a743c7ee856218ce19a726.avif?t=1785257752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras_big/6e1cbafe38a743c7ee856218ce19a726.webp?t=1785257752 width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every song you own is a level you haven't played yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop any audio file and Void Step analyzes its beats, energy, and structure. Calm sections slow down. Drops accelerate. Every jump, every slide, every obstacle lands on a musical beat. Your actions ARE the rhythm. Dubstep builds frantic gauntlets. Lo-fi builds flowing runs. The same game feels completely different with every song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/73399b9283373589e5c14a9ab16e3d57.poster.avif?t=1785257752\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/73399b9283373589e5c14a9ab16e3d57.webm?t=1785257752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/73399b9283373589e5c14a9ab16e3d57.mp4?t=1785257752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/017cd30798f939924a50e4da49523f9e.avif?t=1785257752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras_big/017cd30798f939924a50e4da49523f9e.webp?t=1785257752 width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels in a full 3D editor packed with platforms, hazards, and music-reactive elements. Upload to the community and watch players worldwide compete for the top spot on your level's leaderboard. Play what others have built. Rate, compete, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/179e86adb0b87114060f2a5c06667b42.poster.avif?t=1785257752\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/179e86adb0b87114060f2a5c06667b42.webm?t=1785257752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/179e86adb0b87114060f2a5c06667b42.mp4?t=1785257752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature list:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop any song and the game builds a full level from its rhythm and energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action lands on a musical beat. Your inputs ARE the music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm verses slow the world down. Drops accelerate everything. The game breathes with the song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bundled music with with global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 3D level editor with community sharing and per-level leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fetch songs directly from Newgrounds by ID, no files needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist mode so every player can engage on their own terms.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a runner in a neon void. The silent world pulses once again to the music you bring. Race against time, against gravity, against everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/6e1cbafe38a743c7ee856218ce19a726.avif?t=1785257752\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras_big/6e1cbafe38a743c7ee856218ce19a726.webp?t=1785257752 width=1560 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every song you own is a level you haven't played yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop any audio file and Void Step analyzes its beats, energy, and structure. Calm sections slow down. Drops accelerate. Every jump, every slide, every obstacle lands on a musical beat. Your actions ARE the rhythm. Dubstep builds frantic gauntlets. Lo-fi builds flowing runs. The same game feels completely different with every song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/73399b9283373589e5c14a9ab16e3d57.poster.avif?t=1785257752\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/73399b9283373589e5c14a9ab16e3d57.webm?t=1785257752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589000/extras/73399b9283373589e5c14a9ab16e3d57.mp4?t=1785257752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://